(7455947, 1181203, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Ribbon, Jake!<br/>I really enjoy exploring all of the image.  I like trying to make a story about what they''re all doing or going to do.  Fun.<br/> <br/>"And I should add, I''m almost glad this didn''t make the 7.0 mark (it was there for 5 days) - I''d hate to have 60% of my 7''s fail to blue. LOL"<br/> <br/>Yeah... mine was high enough (for four/five days) to get on my top nine that show on my profile page.  I was hoping it would stay there.  Oh well.</td>', 'Congratulations on your Ribbon, Jake!I really enjoy exploring all of the image.  I like trying to make a story about what they''re all doing or going to do.  Fun. "And I should add, I''m almost glad this didn''t make the 7.0 mark (it was there for 5 days) - I''d hate to have 60% of my 7''s fail to blue. LOL" Yeah... mine was high enough (for four/five days) to get on my top nine that show on my profile page.  I was hoping it would stay there.  Oh well.', '2016-05-22 12:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
