(7456249, 1180849, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hi Judi, It''s been a while. I follow Lydia on Facebook and saw she posted her blue on there and saw your''s when I came to look. I have to say this is amazing. I have no idea how you get your images to look like this but it''s so surreal and very pretty. Glad to see you are still killing it in ribbons. <br/> <br/>Cheers hun</td>', 'Hi Judi, It''s been a while. I follow Lydia on Facebook and saw she posted her blue on there and saw your''s when I came to look. I have to say this is amazing. I have no idea how you get your images to look like this but it''s so surreal and very pretty. Glad to see you are still killing it in ribbons.  Cheers hun', '2016-05-23 16:32:40.000000', NULL, 0);
